[{:db/id "q-7790/selection/27af7b91817eda005dea164c72ab0d1bd23d0d4ea1c2627b5e2d64e270c07cf2" :answer/id #uuid "8e7c6f07-551e-566b-94fa-1eb031a524d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{-2x+2}+{e}^{7x-7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7790/selection/69feacf8504b96dd684946c6214c704384ab7caba5d79c1301557734512f2c00" :answer/id #uuid "2d95825b-c7f7-5fd4-948d-cf5bc1679bb3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=4{e}^{-3x}-2{e}^{4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7790/selection/9e835ca5fe70a4c422116330807b16f420b2a95f16c10f6edefe9ad0bf1e0740" :answer/id #uuid "46815c9f-11c7-50a1-9914-766d161bbd11" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=5{e}^{-2x+2}-3{e}^{7x-7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7790/selection/e49230e1274383bb3f596e42ecad84343fe932deff891cbd3f1d8ff67d5cd973" :answer/id #uuid "99abce99-e974-5477-8ba2-058827f4a9c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{3x-3}+{e}^{4x-4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7790/selection/22394ffaf50ce8034774cfdd475ab435be1500384c331837d32546901482c1a7" :answer/id #uuid "afb816d8-375d-5e07-8df5-9b832dec3d4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=4{e}^{-2x+2}-2{e}^{7x-7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7790/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a868008f-bd31-5131-8f06-1fe899a38725" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-7790/selection/27af7b91817eda005dea164c72ab0d1bd23d0d4ea1c2627b5e2d64e270c07cf2" :answer-field/choices ["q-7790/selection/27af7b91817eda005dea164c72ab0d1bd23d0d4ea1c2627b5e2d64e270c07cf2" "q-7790/selection/69feacf8504b96dd684946c6214c704384ab7caba5d79c1301557734512f2c00" "q-7790/selection/9e835ca5fe70a4c422116330807b16f420b2a95f16c10f6edefe9ad0bf1e0740" "q-7790/selection/e49230e1274383bb3f596e42ecad84343fe932deff891cbd3f1d8ff67d5cd973" "q-7790/selection/22394ffaf50ce8034774cfdd475ab435be1500384c331837d32546901482c1a7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-7790" :question/id #uuid "20ad2806-b368-58f5-b9aa-01f5f872cbb7" :question/math-academy-id "q-7790" :question/problem "Solve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-5{y}^{′}-14y=0,\\,y(1)=2,\\text{ }\\text{ }{y}^{′}(1)=5.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let $y={e}^{\\lambda x}.$ Differentiating $y$ with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x},\\,{y}^{″}={\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}-5\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x}-14{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}-5\\lambda -14) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}-5\\lambda -14 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFactoring the auxiliary equation results in\n\n$$\n(\\lambda +2)(\\lambda -7)=0,\n$$\n\nand so $\\lambda =-2$ or $\\lambda =7.$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{-2x}+B{e}^{7x}.\n$$\n\nNow let us find constants $A$ and $B.$ \n\nSubstituting $y(1)=2$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\nA{e}^{-2}+B{e}^{7}=2.\n$$\n\nWe now need to apply the condition ${y}^{′}(1)=5.$ First, we differentiate $y$ to find ${y}^{′}$:\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=-2A{e}^{-2x}+7B{e}^{7x}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(0)=2$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n-2A{e}^{-2}+7B{e}^{7}=5.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have the following system of equations for $A$ and $B$:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}A{e}^{-2}+B{e}^{7}=2 \\\\ -2A{e}^{-2}+7B{e}^{7}=5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving this system gives $A={e}^{2},B={e}^{-7}.$\n\nNow we get the solution to the initial value problem:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & ={e}^{2}\\cdot {e}^{-2x}+{e}^{-7}\\cdot {e}^{7x} \\\\ y & ={e}^{-2x+2}+{e}^{7x-7}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-7790/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b627c23d-f87b-5fd9-8e53-f2464eecff4d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-7790"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-94011/selection/221d8013ab989014d87f3566743d6e6fcf6fa4ba7bdabba64171ec86d77b332f" :answer/id #uuid "dccb3d31-e17b-505f-9584-a33184329577" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=2{e}^{-5x}-5{e}^{-2x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94011/selection/ddd00bca1d5f9634cb55000fb876f8dc657b9cb91d5587f020f0af1eed84210e" :answer/id #uuid "dc4ed11e-e74c-567f-bceb-5706fefe335c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-{e}^{-5x}-2{e}^{-2x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94011/selection/699531559f9c69a38f7eaabb1ee7206092022bd601f7fb864434b0c9d6daa79e" :answer/id #uuid "6e7898de-ecd3-530b-9400-22682f3c9011" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{-5x}-4{e}^{-2x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94011/selection/951082c1dcb9891d573f2594118eb5f94636ccc49c1853f0ba7f98e16d6c1175" :answer/id #uuid "45a4a64c-6c3c-5ab6-ab84-6eeb422bfa0b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=3{e}^{-5x}-6{e}^{-2x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94011/selection/ec53c5ec4586bdbd9abdbf366dfee87daaecbe9d1f1355fb0978e7cb41c36443" :answer/id #uuid "af7bce6a-2ec2-53cf-92c1-7f25e703d97e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-5{e}^{-5x}+2{e}^{-2x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94011/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "9526b77f-f046-5720-a9de-df60afc0c69f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-94011/selection/951082c1dcb9891d573f2594118eb5f94636ccc49c1853f0ba7f98e16d6c1175" :answer-field/choices ["q-94011/selection/221d8013ab989014d87f3566743d6e6fcf6fa4ba7bdabba64171ec86d77b332f" "q-94011/selection/ddd00bca1d5f9634cb55000fb876f8dc657b9cb91d5587f020f0af1eed84210e" "q-94011/selection/699531559f9c69a38f7eaabb1ee7206092022bd601f7fb864434b0c9d6daa79e" "q-94011/selection/951082c1dcb9891d573f2594118eb5f94636ccc49c1853f0ba7f98e16d6c1175" "q-94011/selection/ec53c5ec4586bdbd9abdbf366dfee87daaecbe9d1f1355fb0978e7cb41c36443"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-94011" :question/id #uuid "fd8751d7-ec69-500b-bd36-468efe567de2" :question/math-academy-id "q-94011" :question/problem "Given that the differential equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+7{y}^{′}+10y=0\n$$\n\nhas the general solution\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{-5x}+B{e}^{-2x},\n$$\n\nsolve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+7{y}^{′}+10y=0,\\,y(0)=-3,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=-3.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We find the constants $A$ and $B$ using the initial conditions. \n\n- Substituting $y(0)=-3$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\nA+B=-3.\n$$\n\n- To apply the condition ${y}^{′}(0)=-3,$ we first differentiate $y$ to get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=-5A{e}^{-5x}-2B{e}^{-2x}.\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute ${y}^{′}(0)=-3$ into the above to get\n\n$$\n-5A-2B=-3.\n$$\n\nPutting the two equations from above together, we have the following system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}A+B=-3 \\\\ -5A-2B=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving this system gives $A=3,B=-6.$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=3{e}^{-5x}-6{e}^{-2x}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-94011/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b627c23d-f87b-5fd9-8e53-f2464eecff4d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-94011"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-7788"] :question/problem "Given that the differential equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+7{y}^{′}+12y=0\n$$\n\nhas the general solution\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{-3x}+B{e}^{-4x},\n$$\n\nsolve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+7{y}^{′}+12y=0,\\,y(0)=-3,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=2.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We find the constants $A$ and $B$ using the initial conditions. \n\n- Substituting $y(0)=-3$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\nA+B=-3.\n$$\n\n- To apply the condition ${y}^{′}(0)=2,$ we first differentiate $y$ to get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=-3A{e}^{-3x}-4B{e}^{-4x}.\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute ${y}^{′}(0)=2$ into the above to get\n\n$$\n-3A-4B=2.\n$$\n\nPutting the two equations from above together, we have the following system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}A+B=-3 \\\\ -3A-4B=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving this system gives $A=-10,B=7.$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=-10{e}^{-3x}+7{e}^{-4x}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-94007/selection/495f181ae197b2464fded184ea499895eefd0d3ac3c988b70b388cc821623e86" :answer/id #uuid "da90fa79-9985-59cd-bb8a-a264870af529" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=8{e}^{2x}+{e}^{4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94007/selection/f3c07db69bec154af8de82d53a49a4d248ea039b664b72cda234bfbb73a489d9" :answer/id #uuid "ccf53b83-5636-50c4-8088-ce1743a5c480" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{2x}+8{e}^{4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94007/selection/ddd032ab17d12204f0f1a05b80f8e6b2e94c16ad4f7a259edbd5ea13d7b0512c" :answer/id #uuid "44d4828a-1a0b-5637-97d3-b93c7546e189" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=2{e}^{2x}+7{e}^{4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94007/selection/b19e2f5d1f1f263f13120a595c2865c05a7d6f8f638a380d802dbf5baa7cb8c5" :answer/id #uuid "311acd2d-3ce3-50ef-80f2-36936e890c26" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=5{e}^{2x}+4{e}^{4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94007/selection/3234c325a3c2a1a1795cfb8312ac6b7e72d2ead17bcaf5bd89fcb979215ad896" :answer/id #uuid "0a9db694-9eae-5d89-a77c-fc45ea265da8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=6{e}^{2x}+3{e}^{4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94007/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d93d7db8-e273-593f-8711-5775bcd6bc87" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-94007/selection/3234c325a3c2a1a1795cfb8312ac6b7e72d2ead17bcaf5bd89fcb979215ad896" :answer-field/choices ["q-94007/selection/495f181ae197b2464fded184ea499895eefd0d3ac3c988b70b388cc821623e86" "q-94007/selection/f3c07db69bec154af8de82d53a49a4d248ea039b664b72cda234bfbb73a489d9" "q-94007/selection/ddd032ab17d12204f0f1a05b80f8e6b2e94c16ad4f7a259edbd5ea13d7b0512c" "q-94007/selection/b19e2f5d1f1f263f13120a595c2865c05a7d6f8f638a380d802dbf5baa7cb8c5" "q-94007/selection/3234c325a3c2a1a1795cfb8312ac6b7e72d2ead17bcaf5bd89fcb979215ad896"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-94007" :question/id #uuid "ee07bcca-f720-5a99-913c-116159fbe1b7" :question/math-academy-id "q-94007" :question/problem "Given that the differential equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-6{y}^{′}+8y=0\n$$\n\nhas the general solution\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{2x}+B{e}^{4x},\n$$\n\nsolve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-6{y}^{′}+8y=0,\\,y(0)=9,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=24.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We find the constants $A$ and $B$ using the initial conditions. \n\n- Substituting $y(0)=9$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\nA+B=9.\n$$\n\n- To apply the condition ${y}^{′}(0)=24,$ we first differentiate $y$ to get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=2A{e}^{2x}+4B{e}^{4x}.\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute ${y}^{′}(0)=24$ into the above to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2A+4B & =24 \\\\ A+2B & =12.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nPutting the two equations from above together, we have the following system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}A+B=9 \\\\ A+2B=12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving this system gives $A=6,B=3.$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=6{e}^{2x}+3{e}^{4x}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-94007/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b627c23d-f87b-5fd9-8e53-f2464eecff4d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-94007"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-94006/selection/2c99163c8a66192b0dc8694322b902c03864e5657af80e10ecde35f71f4131e9" :answer/id #uuid "758ff392-ffd7-5e50-961e-e5dfddf9e6f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-4{e}^{3x}+6{e}^{5x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94006/selection/f01607540c5a12eac98b7a01b741229c9f6b9da8a04701ed5ba612baadcc9c3c" :answer/id #uuid "abee8628-593f-5866-a53c-68ea75cbee5e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-2{e}^{3x}+4{e}^{5x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94006/selection/2af8cac9f53694bf2d2f0c88caba5a2b31138488a4d7a02c08f4660eb033c01e" :answer/id #uuid "ecaad093-51b9-5c48-a30f-0e90f3ae7bdc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=4{e}^{3x}-2{e}^{5x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94006/selection/9e4d550ded26e823ad1973c725837b85609273f7572f2329a732d08bde5cb1fc" :answer/id #uuid "3c370615-6f72-5f33-adc6-745cc9324851" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{3x}+{e}^{5x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94006/selection/e517cba457f15f5fa0624924c1fb3f7e7c0fd62c077b6bcf932c092b251783b6" :answer/id #uuid "656088ee-de36-5735-af19-9e65fa6f89e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=3{e}^{3x}-{e}^{5x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94006/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "691143c8-84f3-5e0b-b36c-20da9420f46f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-94006/selection/2af8cac9f53694bf2d2f0c88caba5a2b31138488a4d7a02c08f4660eb033c01e" :answer-field/choices ["q-94006/selection/2c99163c8a66192b0dc8694322b902c03864e5657af80e10ecde35f71f4131e9" "q-94006/selection/f01607540c5a12eac98b7a01b741229c9f6b9da8a04701ed5ba612baadcc9c3c" "q-94006/selection/2af8cac9f53694bf2d2f0c88caba5a2b31138488a4d7a02c08f4660eb033c01e" "q-94006/selection/9e4d550ded26e823ad1973c725837b85609273f7572f2329a732d08bde5cb1fc" "q-94006/selection/e517cba457f15f5fa0624924c1fb3f7e7c0fd62c077b6bcf932c092b251783b6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-94006" :question/id #uuid "63af8151-cc17-5da4-b2c3-bc920bd1b153" :question/math-academy-id "q-94006" :question/problem "Solve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-8{y}^{′}+15y=0,\\,y(0)=2,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=2.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the roots of the characteristic polynomial:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}-8\\lambda +15 & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda -3)(\\lambda -5) & =0 \\\\ \\lambda  & =3,5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{3x}+B{e}^{5x}.\n$$\n\nNow we find the constants $A$ and $B$ using the initial conditions.\n\n- Substituting $y(0)=2$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\nA+B=2.\n$$\n\n- To apply the condition ${y}^{′}(0)=2,$ we first differentiate $y$ to get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=3A{e}^{3x}+5B{e}^{5x}.\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute ${y}^{′}(0)=2$ into the above to get\n\n$$\n3A+5B=2.\n$$\n\nPutting the two equations from above together, we have the following system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}A+B=2 \\\\ 3A+5B=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving this system gives $A=4,B=-2.$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =4{e}^{3x}-2{e}^{5x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-94006/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b627c23d-f87b-5fd9-8e53-f2464eecff4d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-94006"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130348/selection/73acb38ababa6d0c66023e0bb27a02f5b56dc5af952dbac504a4acd7f31538d7" :answer/id #uuid "c8e72572-e67b-5175-8cb9-b67bd5badd70" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{-4x}+x{e}^{-4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130348/selection/55703cc28d1d9aa9fc80f1280fc91eaa551911d3999ea3dc8e0df3b00455b91d" :answer/id #uuid "3b680f27-1a8b-5f6c-acdb-7a04cbdb139d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{-4x}-x{e}^{-4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130348/selection/0a65fea59f79a8be1e86c52832adceb1b60eb813959525c115a15c1b42506a60" :answer/id #uuid "3c576f38-4fa5-5359-9617-f3c7f962e765" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{-4x}-2x{e}^{-4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130348/selection/8bd8a646b4bfda0f8021580f5ee03cec91828aae9659e6ccc2f272e24c72337a" :answer/id #uuid "a463efeb-a4db-53c2-aaf4-0b3faac4f89f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{-4x}-3x{e}^{-4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130348/selection/d23dc3d405668998d97d151c3d22b6ee6d6d190df602a9ea73d817ea7f2e4a97" :answer/id #uuid "b3149b42-287a-5dcd-91ec-15d80ef84994" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{-4x}+2x{e}^{-4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130348/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "b0e44e5d-3fba-52e8-ac06-b67831bff6eb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130348/selection/d23dc3d405668998d97d151c3d22b6ee6d6d190df602a9ea73d817ea7f2e4a97" :answer-field/choices ["q-130348/selection/73acb38ababa6d0c66023e0bb27a02f5b56dc5af952dbac504a4acd7f31538d7" "q-130348/selection/55703cc28d1d9aa9fc80f1280fc91eaa551911d3999ea3dc8e0df3b00455b91d" "q-130348/selection/0a65fea59f79a8be1e86c52832adceb1b60eb813959525c115a15c1b42506a60" "q-130348/selection/8bd8a646b4bfda0f8021580f5ee03cec91828aae9659e6ccc2f272e24c72337a" "q-130348/selection/d23dc3d405668998d97d151c3d22b6ee6d6d190df602a9ea73d817ea7f2e4a97"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-130348" :question/id #uuid "21de8ce6-7686-5e0d-ab4d-25c83ba08786" :question/math-academy-id "q-130348" :question/problem "Given that the differential equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+8{y}^{′}+16y=0\n$$\n\nhas the general solution\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{-4x}+Bx{e}^{-4x},\n$$\n\nsolve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+8{y}^{′}+16y=0,\\,y(0)=1,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=-2.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We find the constants $A$ and $B$ using the initial conditions. \n\n- Substituting $y(0)=1$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\nA=1.\n$$\n\n- To apply the condition ${y}^{′}(0)=-2,$ we first differentiate $y$ to get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=-4A{e}^{-4x}+B{e}^{-4x}-4Bx{e}^{-4x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(0)=-2$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n-4A+B=-2.\n$$\n\nUsing the fact that $A=1$ gives $B=2.$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny={e}^{-4x}+2x{e}^{-4x}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-130348/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "84e87d0d-806d-5587-849e-17d6999dbbd1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130348"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-65116/selection/3058e655eb732fafc0ace70929b038171a7648e0d02dc5dfb6f6db423712fe32" :answer/id #uuid "8f3a53d5-3690-526f-a59f-fd0938ae5284" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{4x}+2x{e}^{4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65116/selection/416b4eee57ec740630ad786af4e46a7ed50b6b6b4b0896a0aa2b884ff2d2b649" :answer/id #uuid "576d069d-49f0-56e7-861a-12283eda78c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{4x}+4x{e}^{4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65116/selection/cc4b6a759a55720df2b9d81699482da061e5ec5b24d8e5a52370d9231f8ba114" :answer/id #uuid "5fb5167b-a064-5454-88a8-5903f02ce98f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{4x}-5x{e}^{4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65116/selection/26c3e5b2a32894b228b5554264bf793373c05bfe8df2b574c44740cf7922cc6c" :answer/id #uuid "1ac07a54-a9c9-5637-8baf-719d28ab675c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{4x}-6x{e}^{4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65116/selection/f3b42f7141d7a678203c5c52342a74f9995788d84dab05fc78f672c39a7ba032" :answer/id #uuid "3f78acf3-1f5a-500c-a7d8-aec67db137c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{4x}-x{e}^{4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65116/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c18ae508-fe95-5dd8-bcff-ec66264912e2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-65116/selection/cc4b6a759a55720df2b9d81699482da061e5ec5b24d8e5a52370d9231f8ba114" :answer-field/choices ["q-65116/selection/3058e655eb732fafc0ace70929b038171a7648e0d02dc5dfb6f6db423712fe32" "q-65116/selection/416b4eee57ec740630ad786af4e46a7ed50b6b6b4b0896a0aa2b884ff2d2b649" "q-65116/selection/cc4b6a759a55720df2b9d81699482da061e5ec5b24d8e5a52370d9231f8ba114" "q-65116/selection/26c3e5b2a32894b228b5554264bf793373c05bfe8df2b574c44740cf7922cc6c" "q-65116/selection/f3b42f7141d7a678203c5c52342a74f9995788d84dab05fc78f672c39a7ba032"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-65116" :question/id #uuid "d60fdc16-a98e-5a63-a96a-f3e1aec7f662" :question/math-academy-id "q-65116" :question/problem "Given that the functions  ${y}_{1}(x)={e}^{4x}$ and ${y}_{2}(x)=x{e}^{4x}$ are solutions to the equation ${y}^{″}-8{y}^{′}+16y=0,$ solve the following initial value problem.\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-8{y}^{′}+16y=0,\\,y(0)=1,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=-1.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "According to the superposition principle, any linear combination of the functions  ${y}_{1}(x)$  and ${y}_{2}(x)$  must be a solution to the original differential equation.\n\nHence, the general solution is: \n\n$$\ny={c}_{1}{e}^{4x}+{c}_{2}x{e}^{4x}\n$$\n\nNow, we find constants ${c}_{1}$ and ${c}_{2}.$ \n\nSubstituting $y(0)=1$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\n{c}_{1}=1.\n$$\n\nWe now need to apply the condition ${y}^{′}(0)=-1.$ First, we differentiate $y$ to find ${y}^{′}:$ \n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=(4{c}_{1}+{c}_{2}){e}^{4x}+4{c}_{2}x{e}^{4x}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${c}_{1}=1$ and ${y}^{′}(0)=-1$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1=4(1)+{c}_{2}\\,⟹\\,{c}_{2}=-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny={e}^{4x}-5x{e}^{4x}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-65116/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "84e87d0d-806d-5587-849e-17d6999dbbd1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-65116"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-7798/selection/176fd0d7698f16bff48dd7f3cb0431b3d1f613582bb15bf5e8a102bba2cd0f22" :answer/id #uuid "a8b20232-be94-5ef5-ab29-08f1f4291271" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=11{e}^{4x-4}-9x{e}^{4x-4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7798/selection/5bf09387df5afe056a9e961f86f87e7f5c1aeef154277a98736affb3e46d4423" :answer/id #uuid "6c30fd98-942c-5e40-9189-abdb37b8c76f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=5{e}^{4x-4}-3x{e}^{4x-4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7798/selection/5948be53c9cda32df46e76e7eadd810e0b309583c67416d940ec288d30e30ddc" :answer/id #uuid "4369179a-51ef-517f-9308-f10f28df6bf2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-7{e}^{4x-4}+9x{e}^{4x-4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7798/selection/aec1893fdf9b9f389ceb1d5781424f405bea4cf844c590f19d4264d71cf1f4ba" :answer/id #uuid "fb1c2f72-02e9-5de1-9f66-f1411b35f143" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=3{e}^{2x-2}-x{e}^{2x-2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7798/selection/834ad92c078e8dde8c40afc70be2708e9b5aa359cb4e6b5c008ebd8c6111a6a3" :answer/id #uuid "63f40c6e-626f-56f4-8291-c9aab2a3674e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=8{e}^{2x-2}-6x{e}^{2x-2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7798/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "375549a8-7dbb-544a-9cdc-0ffcf0bb4d5c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-7798/selection/176fd0d7698f16bff48dd7f3cb0431b3d1f613582bb15bf5e8a102bba2cd0f22" :answer-field/choices ["q-7798/selection/176fd0d7698f16bff48dd7f3cb0431b3d1f613582bb15bf5e8a102bba2cd0f22" "q-7798/selection/5bf09387df5afe056a9e961f86f87e7f5c1aeef154277a98736affb3e46d4423" "q-7798/selection/5948be53c9cda32df46e76e7eadd810e0b309583c67416d940ec288d30e30ddc" "q-7798/selection/aec1893fdf9b9f389ceb1d5781424f405bea4cf844c590f19d4264d71cf1f4ba" "q-7798/selection/834ad92c078e8dde8c40afc70be2708e9b5aa359cb4e6b5c008ebd8c6111a6a3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-7798" :question/id #uuid "e0ccd8f3-5c55-5b1e-8569-1f7045c0f609" :question/math-academy-id "q-7798" :question/problem "Solve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-8{y}^{′}+16y=0,\\,y(1)=2,\\text{ }\\text{ }{y}^{′}(1)=-1.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let $y={e}^{\\lambda x}.$ Differentiating $y$ with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x},\\,{y}^{″}={\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}-8\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x}+16{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}-8\\lambda +16) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}-8\\lambda +16 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFactoring the auxiliary equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\lambda -4)(\\lambda -4) & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda -4)^{2} & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\lambda =4$ is a repeated root.\n\nSo the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{4x}+Bx{e}^{4x}.\n$$\n\nLet us find constants $A$ and $B.$ \n\nSubstituting $y(1)=2$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\nA{e}^{4}+B{e}^{4}=2.\n$$\n\nWe now need to apply the condition ${y}^{′}(1)=-1.$ First, we differentiate $y$ to find ${y}^{′}$:\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=4A{e}^{4x}+B{e}^{4x}+4Bx{e}^{4x}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(1)=1$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n4A{e}^{4}+5B{e}^{4}=-1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have the following system of equations for $A$ and $B$:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}A{e}^{4}+B{e}^{4}=2 \\\\ 4A{e}^{4}+5B{e}^{4}=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving this system gives $A=11{e}^{-4},B=-9{e}^{-4}.$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =11{e}^{-4}\\cdot {e}^{4x}-9{e}^{-4}\\cdot x{e}^{4x} \\\\  & =11{e}^{4x-4}-9x{e}^{4x-4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-7798/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "84e87d0d-806d-5587-849e-17d6999dbbd1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-7798"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130345/selection/5ab7bf5cfc4eaad6602466ee98e5fef9ce5830da637937edb86f18e57ea808d4" :answer/id #uuid "315616c0-7ca3-580e-b2b9-f7fd7049408a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-5{e}^{10x}+x{e}^{10x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130345/selection/8c76130049e2c5d8741d4007c3282b8434d74422c42fed625d06a2b6d704771f" :answer/id #uuid "072e8115-4c1b-5616-a167-9e243dc4db80" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=5{e}^{-10x}+45x{e}^{-10x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130345/selection/a97f962c7fb793e5107fad90fd506a0f45e3ff0df4269c20999ff1650b47ce4b" :answer/id #uuid "b87f57eb-57b8-5883-8c46-1474293ae08e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=5{e}^{-10x}+27x{e}^{-10x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130345/selection/6c51da0ed0ccd2161337880fda4430470bb92ab19711eb24065c100c9a7c6e76" :answer/id #uuid "13dee64f-f6bb-5e99-b7b9-f7b28103d9e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=5{e}^{-10x}+x{e}^{-10x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130345/selection/a7085ade372e87c8dd0ecaec4634568d8019b72c2a9c3507d2c72a8d5c280009" :answer/id #uuid "7c19de91-0967-58a8-a35f-f9e5c6cace4c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=5{e}^{10x}+2{e}^{-10x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130345/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "9bbd7185-494e-5b1c-8d62-575dd8301a37" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130345/selection/8c76130049e2c5d8741d4007c3282b8434d74422c42fed625d06a2b6d704771f" :answer-field/choices ["q-130345/selection/5ab7bf5cfc4eaad6602466ee98e5fef9ce5830da637937edb86f18e57ea808d4" "q-130345/selection/8c76130049e2c5d8741d4007c3282b8434d74422c42fed625d06a2b6d704771f" "q-130345/selection/a97f962c7fb793e5107fad90fd506a0f45e3ff0df4269c20999ff1650b47ce4b" "q-130345/selection/6c51da0ed0ccd2161337880fda4430470bb92ab19711eb24065c100c9a7c6e76" "q-130345/selection/a7085ade372e87c8dd0ecaec4634568d8019b72c2a9c3507d2c72a8d5c280009"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-130345" :question/id #uuid "fe25c50d-bb40-5711-844b-9e4bb7250580" :question/math-academy-id "q-130345" :question/problem "Solve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+20{y}^{′}+100y=0,\\,y(0)=5,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=-5.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the roots of the characteristic polynomial:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}+20\\lambda +100 & =0 \\\\ {(\\lambda +10)}^{2} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe have a repeated root $\\lambda =-10,$ so we have the following general solution:\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{-10x}+Bx{e}^{-10x}\n$$\n\nWe find the constants $A$ and $B$ using the initial conditions. \n\n- Substituting $y(0)=5$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\nA=5.\n$$\n\n- To apply the condition ${y}^{′}(0)=-5,$ we first differentiate $y$ to get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=-10A{e}^{-10x}+B{e}^{-10x}-10Bx{e}^{-10x}.\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute ${y}^{′}(0)=-5$ into the above to get\n\n$$\n-10A+B=-5.\n$$\n\nUsing the fact that $A=5$ gives $B=45.$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=5{e}^{-10x}+45x{e}^{-10x}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130345/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "84e87d0d-806d-5587-849e-17d6999dbbd1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130345"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-7815/selection/c5c6d449d925177ddc33d0f36c61b1911551a49e9410c93f0f518f06b8967b6b" :answer/id #uuid "3ba91760-ff6f-5324-9e84-f0d9c2613758" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=x{e}^{-3x/2+1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7815/selection/f01761f63cceac912cc3802a591fe2140bc70043859add89aad1e044e0c68011" :answer/id #uuid "7dd7e9ef-71d3-564b-886d-b9aabf10f2c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-2{e}^{x/2-1}+3x{e}^{x/2-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7815/selection/ae082aa27a1807d336485e47d5c3630fcbfb9671e83b63147444bf022699b8ad" :answer/id #uuid "1bab2199-ed90-5590-80ea-4dd87b9ae137" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-{e}^{-3x/2+1}+2x{e}^{-3x/2+1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7815/selection/c23199b5c4d916034d2a48babaaaf4912a75ccd0e128ff63db4a8968a9655241" :answer/id #uuid "7978010e-7173-5709-a51f-f967cb2167ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=3{e}^{-3x/2+1}-2x{e}^{-3x/2+1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7815/selection/d8b7051b4c3cf4bab27eb1581d582d3a30e35fa7db203b463fffe73258659cc1" :answer/id #uuid "319d4375-f62b-578a-9885-af0f9621bb77" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-{e}^{x/2-1}+2x{e}^{x/2-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7815/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0f5db0bb-c444-551a-93b5-46702f40daca" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-7815/selection/ae082aa27a1807d336485e47d5c3630fcbfb9671e83b63147444bf022699b8ad" :answer-field/choices ["q-7815/selection/c5c6d449d925177ddc33d0f36c61b1911551a49e9410c93f0f518f06b8967b6b" "q-7815/selection/f01761f63cceac912cc3802a591fe2140bc70043859add89aad1e044e0c68011" "q-7815/selection/ae082aa27a1807d336485e47d5c3630fcbfb9671e83b63147444bf022699b8ad" "q-7815/selection/c23199b5c4d916034d2a48babaaaf4912a75ccd0e128ff63db4a8968a9655241" "q-7815/selection/d8b7051b4c3cf4bab27eb1581d582d3a30e35fa7db203b463fffe73258659cc1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-7815" :question/id #uuid "cb39f40a-4179-548a-bb21-32e7734a1e56" :question/math-academy-id "q-7815" :question/problem "Solve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+3{y}^{′}+\\frac{9y}{4}=0,\\,y(1)={e}^{-1/2},\\text{ }\\text{ }{y}^{′}(1)=\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{-1/2}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let $y={e}^{\\lambda x}.$ Differentiating $y$ with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x},\\,{y}^{″}={\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}+3\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x}+\\frac{9}{4}{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}+3\\lambda +\\frac{9}{4}) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}+3\\lambda +\\frac{9}{4} & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFactoring the auxiliary equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\lambda +\\frac{3}{2})(\\lambda +\\frac{3}{2}) & =0 \\\\ {(\\lambda +\\frac{3}{2})}^{2} & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\lambda =\\frac{3}{2}$ is a repeated root.\n\nSo the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{-3x/2}+Bx{e}^{-3x/2}.\n$$\n\nLet us find constants $A$ and $B.$ \nSubstituting $y(1)={e}^{-1/2}$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A{e}^{-3/2}+B{e}^{-3/2} & ={e}^{-1/2} \\\\ A+B & =e.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now need to apply the condition ${y}^{′}(1)=\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{-1/2}.$ First, we differentiate $y$ to find ${y}^{′}$:\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=-\\frac{3}{2}A{e}^{-3/2x}+B{e}^{-3/2x}-\\frac{3}{2}Bx{e}^{-3/2x}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(1)=\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{-1/2}$ into the above gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{3}{2}A{e}^{-3/2}-\\frac{1}{2}B{e}^{-3/2} & =\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{-1/2} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{2}A-\\frac{1}{2}B & =\\frac{1}{2}e \\\\ -3A-B & =e\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have the following system of equations for $A$ and $B$:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}A+B=e \\\\ -3A-B=e\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving this system gives $A=-e,B=2e.$\n\nNow we get the solution to the initial value problem:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-e\\cdot {e}^{-3x/2}+2e\\cdot x{e}^{-3x/2} \\\\  & =-{e}^{-3x/2+1}+2x{e}^{-3x/2+1}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-7815/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "84e87d0d-806d-5587-849e-17d6999dbbd1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-7815"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-94023/selection/72608e2edd64b149915f74209a11f2de41974951e83df27f75bd8c2686d20a9e" :answer/id #uuid "54b45f5e-eedb-50a6-bbbb-137f60cedf89" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡8x+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡8x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94023/selection/4c2064c4cbc133db267a2b1b4ebaf33e99042f1961e6b97b28e5158f02012b52" :answer/id #uuid "0f910652-235b-55d8-ab67-80914cae2701" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡8x-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡8x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94023/selection/0235c53288cdeefd1ceb0180d7d6e1fe111ba7ccc3d5aa5e7a855f17e66f711f" :answer/id #uuid "676dc692-cca3-5b34-82c4-ce656d1969a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡8x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡8x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94023/selection/2b27f3a7d8493feea57af16c938c44d00647bb6588f9d66374784297ddcc8636" :answer/id #uuid "b6e1c5d8-159a-5b7e-a8b9-082c068c8ba9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡8x+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡8x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94023/selection/5279f4bc042ba30910176bca2c97ed71997d2d5273c2cb6c5ec0a7332909adaa" :answer/id #uuid "df794363-5215-5e07-aa31-30f157bda7c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡8x-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡8x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94023/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ef4333e5-200a-5aef-99c0-c269ffae6117" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-94023/selection/2b27f3a7d8493feea57af16c938c44d00647bb6588f9d66374784297ddcc8636" :answer-field/choices ["q-94023/selection/72608e2edd64b149915f74209a11f2de41974951e83df27f75bd8c2686d20a9e" "q-94023/selection/4c2064c4cbc133db267a2b1b4ebaf33e99042f1961e6b97b28e5158f02012b52" "q-94023/selection/0235c53288cdeefd1ceb0180d7d6e1fe111ba7ccc3d5aa5e7a855f17e66f711f" "q-94023/selection/2b27f3a7d8493feea57af16c938c44d00647bb6588f9d66374784297ddcc8636" "q-94023/selection/5279f4bc042ba30910176bca2c97ed71997d2d5273c2cb6c5ec0a7332909adaa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-94023" :question/id #uuid "dce56cba-a1b7-565e-a887-b1008bc35de3" :question/math-academy-id "q-94023" :question/problem "Solve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+64y=0,\\,y(\\pi )=1,\\,{y}^{′}(\\pi )=4.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the roots of the characteristic polynomial:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}+64 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2} & =-64 \\\\ \\lambda  & =\\pm 8\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have the following general solution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =P\\operatorname{cos}⁡8x+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡8x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe find the constants $P$ and $Q$ using the initial conditions.\n\n- Substituting $y(\\pi )=1$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- To apply the condition ${y}^{′}(\\pi )=4,$ we first differentiate $y$ to get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=-8P\\operatorname{sin}⁡8x+8Q\\operatorname{cos}⁡8x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(\\pi )=4$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8Q=4\\,⟹\\,Q=\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=\\operatorname{cos}⁡8x+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡8x.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-94023/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8ebb2332-3e40-5627-bc43-258ca4a80424"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-94023"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-94022/selection/ef2682889a003b094293de240ac316c440f58b79564cac118146e980e0929e94" :answer/id #uuid "d4421a39-30f4-5cf5-a99f-5cf2eec56210" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94022/selection/35bea4173b47dda405c9095bda22bc2550470354e5bf9c9b148dc43e9ac40bfe" :answer/id #uuid "784f32a9-a698-58ec-bd9f-6cb085f1ba7f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94022/selection/a055910dc6d91216e2e93b419c9c00dc3a1cfc2646456e089e43c8d9de9fadad" :answer/id #uuid "796c1627-3ead-51de-a4ec-c336e22f4060" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94022/selection/6584e60b3e50f604708054e25df61c8819c0265af06a54e7ea2c53dcf6ec2161" :answer/id #uuid "e7ccb4c0-103d-59de-bab3-7c5fe31f32ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x-7\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94022/selection/e73f344dd2a3b5b2ca73ba5308234cc5231304ec4736fae49c24e14feea03c08" :answer/id #uuid "c7bd9baa-df47-55fa-b5d1-0c517777ae53" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94022/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "10447009-d992-5242-a848-1377014b93e0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-94022/selection/35bea4173b47dda405c9095bda22bc2550470354e5bf9c9b148dc43e9ac40bfe" :answer-field/choices ["q-94022/selection/ef2682889a003b094293de240ac316c440f58b79564cac118146e980e0929e94" "q-94022/selection/35bea4173b47dda405c9095bda22bc2550470354e5bf9c9b148dc43e9ac40bfe" "q-94022/selection/a055910dc6d91216e2e93b419c9c00dc3a1cfc2646456e089e43c8d9de9fadad" "q-94022/selection/6584e60b3e50f604708054e25df61c8819c0265af06a54e7ea2c53dcf6ec2161" "q-94022/selection/e73f344dd2a3b5b2ca73ba5308234cc5231304ec4736fae49c24e14feea03c08"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-94022" :question/id #uuid "04610593-0b82-57e6-91c1-fedf291e9236" :question/math-academy-id "q-94022" :question/problem "Solve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+49y=0,\\,y(\\pi )=-2,\\,{y}^{′}(\\pi )=7.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the roots of the characteristic polynomial:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}+49 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2} & =-49 \\\\ \\lambda  & =\\pm 7\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have the following general solution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =P\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe find the constants $P$ and $Q$ using the initial conditions.\n\n- Substituting $y(\\pi )=-2$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-P=-2\\,⟹\\,P=2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- To apply the condition ${y}^{′}(\\pi )=7,$ we first differentiate $y$ to get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=-7P\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x+7Q\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(\\pi )=7$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-7Q=7\\,⟹\\,Q=-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡7x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡7x.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-94022/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8ebb2332-3e40-5627-bc43-258ca4a80424"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-94022"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130355/selection/f10b35531204fe98bd82e969e3778d6617b8026adaf44c73fa01d2301fa87520" :answer/id #uuid "9f2428b2-73a5-5b19-81f2-ae9abd4c30b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x+10\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130355/selection/289f91fb07c3a20b65c45bd4c40f77564e078f8ff041cd5f2049c93e6a02109f" :answer/id #uuid "9def854b-cdb9-5a8d-85f1-ddc7bb39fe33" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=5\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x+10\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130355/selection/b976750c9b75a6d2aa056b6236158b32305f13fb36a6e008af018ca6e0c967cd" :answer/id #uuid "c7da6a7a-9196-5b48-bd9f-126e43724726" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-5\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x+10\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130355/selection/184aed603ca82e37aa0b0025151ebc7e37778094393f68876e6d491e30f16e51" :answer/id #uuid "9d2e44a5-505c-53cf-bc55-fb16db32e187" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=10\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x+10\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130355/selection/a41291b254e38c1eaaa0e848266b21a7a1819e7e406361f7122df8414c4e398b" :answer/id #uuid "f0835121-0568-56a0-8b34-e714e0a83785" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=10\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130355/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0fe1d37c-447f-5c6f-9fba-10123ca1e96d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130355/selection/b976750c9b75a6d2aa056b6236158b32305f13fb36a6e008af018ca6e0c967cd" :answer-field/choices ["q-130355/selection/f10b35531204fe98bd82e969e3778d6617b8026adaf44c73fa01d2301fa87520" "q-130355/selection/289f91fb07c3a20b65c45bd4c40f77564e078f8ff041cd5f2049c93e6a02109f" "q-130355/selection/b976750c9b75a6d2aa056b6236158b32305f13fb36a6e008af018ca6e0c967cd" "q-130355/selection/184aed603ca82e37aa0b0025151ebc7e37778094393f68876e6d491e30f16e51" "q-130355/selection/a41291b254e38c1eaaa0e848266b21a7a1819e7e406361f7122df8414c4e398b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-130355" :question/id #uuid "d1c172fd-ed64-5bde-930c-1a084c8ba535" :question/math-academy-id "q-130355" :question/problem "Solve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+100y=0,\\,y(\\frac{\\pi }{4})=10,\\,{y}^{′}(\\frac{\\pi }{4})=50.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the roots of the characteristic polynomial:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}+100 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2} & =-100 \\\\ \\lambda  & =\\pm 10\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have the following general solution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =P\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe find the constants $P$ and $Q$ using the initial conditions.\n\n- Substituting $y(\\frac{\\pi }{4})=10$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Q=10.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- To apply the condition ${y}^{′}(\\frac{\\pi }{4})=50,$ we first differentiate $y$ to get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=-10P\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x+10Q\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(\\frac{\\pi }{4})=50$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-10P=50\\,⟹\\,P=-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=-5\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x+10\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130355/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8ebb2332-3e40-5627-bc43-258ca4a80424"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130355"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130356/selection/69c6951739e3d262b5a48bfac644e2bcbf762a33dbdbbad46cac95a7b32c9604" :answer/id #uuid "833e99d9-6b45-57ce-aab8-d29682230a2b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡12x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130356/selection/9db015c8fac632a0f7d1bfc552cd28711d564d666204899de3f911a040585871" :answer/id #uuid "d77ad588-3025-5b6f-a064-1f7d6013c706" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡12x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡12x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130356/selection/c428152c5fd12aaf1a2e788a701679325b0c16e8446bb48d1adad8241196c35e" :answer/id #uuid "0525068b-fa7a-5590-b611-f6b8b1b7cdf4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-\\operatorname{cos}⁡12x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡12x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130356/selection/d56d8022de3536c240189d777a76d50cea704aa9e6c95f043a2ab9df53b0bf61" :answer/id #uuid "00f7245a-fb37-5e11-9b92-bdf761f219c9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡12x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130356/selection/bfa62a91488dc0207737e475914e82c8d2b806a49d8ba479ff0229909e222a03" :answer/id #u