gned}12P=24\\,⟹\\,P=2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡12x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡12x.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130356/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8ebb2332-3e40-5627-bc43-258ca4a80424"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130356"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-94020/selection/518163cf43c4974ee11363a4a03dfdb5db4de3b9972538a963ed78d2f760e2ba" :answer/id #uuid "0ca3eec8-cd11-50a4-8a0f-d5ee06fb1c59" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+4\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94020/selection/6dc92fa5219debdc965c34e8276cd3c8bee29f5bb5d3f7db7b4e939c51fb92f1" :answer/id #uuid "7ce27735-9b0e-5971-a480-4d617b265903" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+4\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94020/selection/22dba3cf08d05758740c6450b5d60acc51557de44196872593ba32d1e7c68751" :answer/id #uuid "d77a79a7-541f-5517-b8f3-7ee6ba0aecaf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94020/selection/b65c8b45b7f01c9ef2aca11dff77f4af6585a9c16935800f53ea5de7712c349c" :answer/id #uuid "639d7e19-f11f-5797-a731-97c89178a830" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)-4\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94020/selection/2913a083e27738f4846485f010b2f51b0119e8e5ef1145c8f97d53bd17616dd3" :answer/id #uuid "13e0b305-22c9-525c-a023-d2e7884fbf35" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94020/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "95947d8b-a944-568e-a568-3a93e2571e60" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-94020/selection/518163cf43c4974ee11363a4a03dfdb5db4de3b9972538a963ed78d2f760e2ba" :answer-field/choices ["q-94020/selection/518163cf43c4974ee11363a4a03dfdb5db4de3b9972538a963ed78d2f760e2ba" "q-94020/selection/6dc92fa5219debdc965c34e8276cd3c8bee29f5bb5d3f7db7b4e939c51fb92f1" "q-94020/selection/22dba3cf08d05758740c6450b5d60acc51557de44196872593ba32d1e7c68751" "q-94020/selection/b65c8b45b7f01c9ef2aca11dff77f4af6585a9c16935800f53ea5de7712c349c" "q-94020/selection/2913a083e27738f4846485f010b2f51b0119e8e5ef1145c8f97d53bd17616dd3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-94020" :question/id #uuid "e8225538-dd4a-5803-9324-e3d8809baf26" :question/math-academy-id "q-94020" :question/problem "Solve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+2y=0,\\,y(0)=-4,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=4\\sqrt{2}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the roots of the characteristic polynomial:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}+2 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2} & =-2 \\\\ \\lambda  & =\\pm \\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have the following general solution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe find the constants $P$ and $Q$ using the initial conditions.\n\n- Substituting $y(0)=-4$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P=-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- To apply the condition ${y}^{′}(0)=4\\sqrt{2},$ we first differentiate $y$ to get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=-\\sqrt{2}P\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+\\sqrt{2}Q\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x).\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(0)=4\\sqrt{2}$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{2}Q=4\\sqrt{2}\\,⟹\\,Q=4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+4\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x).\n$$" :question/difficulty :question